{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesgoogledrive"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","externalID":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive","modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive"}],"title":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive","symbolKind":"module"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Google Drive cloud backend for Ensembles."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveAuthenticator"],"anchor":"Cloud-File-System","title":"Cloud File System"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive provides ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem"},{"text":", an implementation of the Ensembles ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol that stores sync data on Google Drive. It communicates directly with the Google Drive REST API v3 using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession"},{"text":" — no third-party SDK required.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Drive uses file IDs rather than paths internally. The backend transparently bridges between Ensembles’ path-based ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol and Google Drive’s ID-based system, caching folder and file IDs to minimize API calls.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Authentication","type":"heading